OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources', says Kremlin
OL,5,Aadviser
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrei Fedorov, an adviser to the
OL,8,FKremlin, says there might be a
OL,9,F"semi-military" response against UK
OL,10,Fdrone factories by "unknown sources"
OL,11,Fover the sharing of blueprints for
OL,12,FBritish-made cruise missile components.
OL,14,FHis comments on BBC Newsnight come as
OL,15,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham says he
OL,16,Fplans to travel to the US next month
OL,17,Fwith European leaders to lobby US
OL,18,FPresident Trump on Ukraine's defence
OL,19,Fneeds.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
