OL,3,AOrganised crime arrests in A66 crash
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the early hours of Saturday, a
OL,7,FVolkswagen Passat that had been pursued
OL,8,Fby police travelled the wrong way down
OL,9,Fthe A66 near Middlesbrough and crashed
OL,10,Finto an oncoming police car - two PCs
OL,11,Fand all five Passat occupants died.
OL,13,FCleveland Police said it was
OL,14,Finvestigating "serious criminal
OL,15,Factivity that resulted in this fatal
OL,16,Fincident".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
