OL,4,Aafter car gets stuck in mud
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoaring temperatures across the United
OL,7,FStates have caused millions of people
OL,8,Fto sweat through record heatwaves,
OL,9,Fleading to dozens of heat-related
OL,10,Fdeaths.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
