OL,3,AKit Harington replaces Nicholas Hoult
OL,4,Ain HBO's Harry Potter series
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm a huge Potter fan. I've got to be
OL,7,Fhonest, he's one of my favourite
OL,8,Fcharacters," Harington told Collider.
OL,9,F"So, to be offered to play him is a
OL,10,Freal dream. I've had a taste of him [in
OL,11,Fthe audiobook] and felt my way around
OL,12,Fhim. He's just a wonderful creation."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
